#!/bin/bash
# docker -> finch shim for `kind build node-image` (Docker Desktop not allowed).
# nerdctl commit does not support --change ENV; drop those (kind only sets empty proxies).
if [ "$1" = "commit" ]; then
  args=(); skip=0
  for a in "$@"; do
    if [ $skip = 1 ]; then skip=0; case "$a" in ENV*) continue;; *) args+=(--change "$a"); continue;; esac; fi
    if [ "$a" = "--change" ]; then skip=1; continue; fi
    args+=("$a")
  done
  exec finch "${args[@]}"
fi
exec finch "$@"
